@stepanblyschak Could you help check the issue?

In yang model, the ACL_TABLE_TYPE/actions is a string as [link](https://github.com/Azure/sonic-buildimage/blob/09b0cc2ccef41bf0fbb0fa4d42bca28f37e13f59/src/sonic-yang-models/yang-templates/sonic-acl.yang.j2#L270)

However, in swss schema ACL_TABLE_TYPE_ACTIONS value is a list of strings as [link](https://github.com/Azure/sonic-swss/blob/d9e72a9677b896058021913d412dad83503d79b6/doc/Configuration.md#acl-and-mirroring)
